        "title": "Culinary History - Overview",
        "updated": "null"
      },
      "text": "```\nCOOKING AS COMPOUNDING TECHNOLOGY\n──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\nFIRE & COOKING        AGRICULTURE          PRESERVATION         INDUSTRIALIZATION\n~1,000,000 BP         ~10,000 BP           ~5,000 BP → cont.    ~200 years ago\n     │                     │                    │                     │\n     ▼                     ▼                    ▼                     ▼\nExternal digestion   Sedentary surplus    Trade networks        Caloric abundance\nBrain growth         State formation      Urban civilization    Global homogenization\nSocial bonding       Division of labor    Long voyages          Chronic disease shift\n     │                     │                    │                     │\n     └─────────────────────┴────────────────────┴─────────────────────┘\n                                  │\n                                  ▼\n                         GLOBAL FOOD SYSTEM\n                 7.8B people fed by ~12 plant species\n                 and 5 animal species at industrial scale\n```"
    },
