      },
      "text": "**The ruthless summary:** Cooking externalizes digestion (frees energy for brain growth), agriculture enables surplus (enables civilization), preservation enables trade (enables empires), industrialization enables scale (enables modern population) — and each transition has equal and opposite consequences."
    },
